<ns0:section xmlns:ns0="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="idb9665845-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8" identifier="/us/usc/t18/s2338"><ns0:num value="2338">§ 2338.</ns0:num><ns0:heading> Exclusive Federal jurisdiction</ns0:heading><ns0:content>
<ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">The district courts of the United States shall have exclusive jurisdiction over an action brought under this chapter.</ns0:p>
</ns0:content><ns0:sourceCredit id="idb9665846-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8">(Added <ns0:ref href="/us/pl/102/572/tX/s1003/a/4">Pub. L. 102–572, title X, § 1003(a)(4)</ns0:ref>, <ns0:date date="1992-10-29">Oct. 29, 1992</ns0:date>, <ns0:ref href="/us/stat/106/4524">106 Stat. 4524</ns0:ref>.)</ns0:sourceCredit>
<ns0:notes type="uscNote" id="idb9665847-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8">
<ns0:note style="-uslm-lc:I74" role="crossHeading" topic="statutoryNotes" id="idb9665848-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8"><ns0:heading class="centered"><ns0:b>Statutory Notes and Related Subsidiaries</ns0:b></ns0:heading></ns0:note>
<ns0:note style="-uslm-lc:I74" topic="effectiveDate" id="idb9665849-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8"><ns0:heading class="centered smallCaps">Effective Date</ns0:heading><ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">Section applicable to any pending case or any cause of action arising on or after 4 years before <ns0:date date="1992-10-29">Oct. 29, 1992</ns0:date>, see <ns0:ref href="/us/pl/102/572/s1003/c">section 1003(c) of Pub. L. 102–572</ns0:ref>, set out as a note under <ns0:ref href="/us/usc/t18/s2331">section 2331 of this title</ns0:ref>.</ns0:p>
</ns0:note>
</ns0:notes>
